              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioners ask the Court to reverse the jury verdicts and enter judgment for the defendants if it agrees with the Hobbs Act arguments."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c05e2a2ea10f6cec63b5a45c58f2f11c6a0e6308fab004255aeef0c154cf3ada",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c05e2a2ea10f-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Even if the Court follows the arguments in the red and gray briefs, the petitioners say it should still reverse the verdicts and order a new trial."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c05e2a2ea10f6cec63b5a45c58f2f11c6a0e6308fab004255aeef0c154cf3ada",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c05e2a2ea10f-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioners argue that the RICO injunction should be reversed because RICO does not authorize private injunctive relief."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MS. CLAYTON",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c05e2a2ea10f6cec63b5a45c58f2f11c6a0e6308fab004255aeef0c154cf3ada",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c05e2a2ea10f-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Ms. Clayton argues that private parties have long possessed the right to seek divestiture of a business under antitrust law, predating RICO."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c05e2a2ea10f6cec63b5a45c58f2f11c6a0e6308fab004255aeef0c154cf3ada",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c05e2a2ea10f-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to United States (Amicus Curiae), the right to control a business, whether or not for profit, is a well\u2011recognized and longstanding property interest."
      }
